# ==============================================================================
# Rule Name: Discord (Custom)
# Description: Discord communication platform
# Scope: Discord chat, voice, gateway, CDN, and invite endpoints
# ==============================================================================

# Target: Core Discord web, voice, and media gateway
# Evidence: Discord desktop client and mobile app telemetry, 2026-09-28
# Reason: Baseline anchors; upstream provides full coverage of Discord media endpoints
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,discord.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,discordapp.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,discordapp.net
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,discord.gg
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,discord.media
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,discordstatus.com
DOMAIN-KEYWORD,discord
